  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:252px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Embercore_Thornlash.jpg\" title=\"Embercore Thornlash\"><img alt=\"Embercore Thornlash\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"219\" src=\"/images/Embercore_Thornlash.jpg\" width=\"250\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Embercore_Thornlash.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Embercore Thornlash</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:252px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Toxic_Mangler.jpg\" title=\"Toxic Mangler\"><img alt=\"Toxic Mangler\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"250\" src=\"/images/Toxic_Mangler.jpg\" width=\"250\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Toxic_Mangler.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Toxic Mangler</div></div></div>\n<p><b>Race: </b> Demons\n</p><p><b>Class: </b>Melee\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<a name=\"Basic_Types\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Basic Types</span></h2>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name\n</th><th>Element\n</th><th>Habitat\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Frigidly Cruel Mauler\n</td><td>Ice\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/The_Embercore_Path\" title=\"The Embercore Path\">The Embercore Path</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Embercore Thornlash\n</td><td>Fire\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/The_Embercore_Path\" title=\"The Embercore Path\">The Embercore Path</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Toxic Mangler\n</td><td>Poison\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/The_Widower's_Nest\" title=\"The Widower's Nest\">The Widower's Nest</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Balzack's_Burrow\" title=\"Balzack's Burrow\">Balzack's Burrow</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Divine Reaver\n</td><td>Divine\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/The_Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"The Shadow's Embrace\">The Shadow's Embrace</a> level 5 - 7,  Lava Crypts\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shadow Reaver\n</td><td>Shadow\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Mania\" title=\"Mutant Mania\">Mutant Mania</a> offs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shadowspawn Reaver\n</td><td>Shadow\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/The_Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"The Shadow's Embrace\">The Shadow's Embrace</a> level 5 - 7,  Lava Crypts, <a href=\"/wiki/Ratsputin's_Gulag\" title=\"Ratsputin's Gulag\">Ratsputin's Gulag</a> lower offs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>[GoS] dark reaver\n</td><td>Shadow\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/The_Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"The Shadow's Embrace\">The Shadow's Embrace</a> GoS offs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>[1/2] Reaver\n</td><td>Divine\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/The_Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"The Shadow's Embrace\">The Shadow's Embrace</a> offs\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<p><b>TIP:</b> <i>These guys can do a lot of damage with their close up slashing attacks.  Mages and rangers should try to keep away from them and hit them with ranged damage.</i>\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
